### Variables
@host = http://localhost:8080/api


### =========================================================================
### 1. SUCCESS TESTS (POST a user, a product, a cart item -> 201 Created)
### =========================================================================

### Create a User
POST {{host}}/public/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "john_doe",
  "email": "john@example.com"
}

### Create a Product
POST {{host}}/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Gaming Mouse",
  "price": 59.99,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "stock": 100
}

### Add an Item to Cart
POST {{host}}/public/carts/1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}


### =========================================================================
### 2. ID GENERATION TEST (Send "userId": 10 on create -> Ignored by DB)
### =========================================================================

### Create User with explicit ID (Targets /public/users as defined in UserController)
POST {{host}}/public/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 10,
  "userName": "jane_doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com"
}


### =========================================================================
### 3. MISSING ID ERROR TESTS (GET / PUT / DELETE a missing ID -> 404 Not Found)
### =========================================================================

### GET a missing product ID
GET {{host}}/public/products/9999

### PUT to update a missing product ID
PUT {{host}}/admin/products/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Non-existent Product",
  "price": 10.00,
  "category": "None",
  "stock": 0
}

### DELETE a missing product ID
DELETE {{host}}/admin/products/9999


### =========================================================================
### 4. MISSING PRODUCT IN CART TEST (Add cart item for missing product -> 404)
### =========================================================================

### Add a cart item with a non-existent product ID
POST {{host}}/public/carts/1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 9999,
  "quantity": 1
}
